		{
			dependencies: ["391E9FA027FD4A64"]
			description: ["The &6Millikelvin Cryostat Works&r, &6Femtosecond Writer&r, &6TFLN Fab&r, &6BEUV Scanner&r, &6STM Lithography Cell&r, &6SNSPD Foundry&r, &6Levitation Melter&r and &6Photonic Integration Hall&r take rows for superfluid helium-3, tetron tests, smart cuts, six masks and the cosmic mainframe join. The UIV and UEV controllers you already own, and silicon-28 from the implanter. The tetron array, the bonded die and the cosmic mainframe. Dies and wafers by bus. Failed tetron dies go back through the cascade for indium and niobium."]
