			y: 11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32D17A8DE6EDF4A0"]
			description: ["The &6Tetron Fab&r grows two nanowires, bonds a superconducting backbone between them and tests the parity of the pair. Nothing older builds a qubit that is read that way. An OpV hull, the plascrete shell, cleanroom glass and a superconducting coil, with silicon-28 wafers to work on. Its shape is 17 by 11 by 15, built by the Terminal in 2 passes. The tetron die and the tetron array, which the chain parts need. Wafers and metals by ME; failed dies come out in their own output, so route them back to the start."]
			icon: "gtceu:tetron_fab"
			id: "11AA3FE52CF398DB"
			rewards: [{ id: "7C5B16C1BEF5B4E4", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "769C855660319FF4", item: "gtceu:tetron_fab", type: "item" }
				{ id: "14194C869944A1A2", item: "gtceu:plascrete", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1C9C79F60285B3D7", item: "gtceu:cleanroom_glass", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3DFABE985C0AAC85", item: "gtceu:superconducting_coil", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Tetron Fab"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["11AA3FE52CF398DB"]
			description: ["The &6Gated 2DEG Wafer&r is a layered wafer whose electron sheet is switched by a gate. The tetron fab builds its nanowires from it."]
			icon: "grindless:gated_2deg_wafer"
			id: "7B71C07475CE03D9"
			rewards: [{ id: "348D29532DC6ED1A", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1E3CBC039DE0A1A5", item: "grindless:gated_2deg_wafer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gated 2DEG Wafer"
			x: 12.5d
			y: 11.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32D17A8DE6EDF4A0"]
			description: ["The &6Gamma Optics Works&r focuses gamma rays by Laue lensing, which nothing older can do. Gamma light of this energy only bends in a crystal. An OpV hull, the high power casing and laminated glass, and a Th-229 lasing crystal in the controller. Its shape is 31 by 9 by 9, built by the Terminal in one pass. The Laue lens, the gamma multilayer mirror and the gamma focus element. The lens and the mirror focus the Kugelblitz seed, and the mirror goes on into the Hawking drive and the MAX casing. Run each optic on its own circuit and keep a small stock of all three."]
			icon: "gtceu:gamma_optics_works"
			id: "1F29C7B921EC10C4"
			rewards: [{ id: "5F3873AE089D0581", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5D500BC6C3A9ACB1", item: "gtceu:gamma_optics_works", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5854F180AAE75908", item: "gtceu:high_power_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1ADC90F202E9D6DD", item: "gtceu:laminated_glass", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Gamma Optics Works"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 9.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F29C7B921EC10C4"]
			description: ["The &6HPGE Compton Crystal&r is germanium pure enough to count single gamma rays, cooled in a closed helium loop. It is the eye of the OpV sensor."]
			icon: "grindless:hpge_compton_crystal"
			id: "3D43FF6312199146"
			rewards: [{ id: "728BCE70ACA5C9AB", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "120AFCF178DB8090", item: "grindless:hpge_compton_crystal", type: "item" }]
			title: "HPGE Compton Crystal"
			x: 12.5d
			y: 9.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32D17A8DE6EDF4A0"]
			description: ["The &6Antihydrogen Foundry&r merges antiprotons and positrons in a trap, cools the atoms with a laser and freezes them into a cell. It is the first neutral antimatter in the pack. An OpV hull, the NEG XHV casing and the annihilation shield casing, a levitation trap cell and a Lyman-alpha laser, then antiprotons and positrons to work on. Its shape is 25 by 11 by 13, built by the Terminal in 2 passes. The antihydrogen ice cell, which the Kugelblitz core and the annihilation engine need. Antiprotons and positrons by the beam lines; cells are the product to chest."]
			icon: "gtceu:antihydrogen_foundry"
			id: "597A9984A1B74479"
			rewards: [{ id: "1D0E3BF3B30AB3B6", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5228845410A85BD5", item: "gtceu:antihydrogen_foundry", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3E567C1B9FE94A60", item: "grindless:neg_xhv_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1935AEDC98DAC0BB", item: "grindless:annihilation_shield_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Antihydrogen Foundry"
			x: 12.5d
			y: 12.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["597A9984A1B74479"]
			description: ["The &6Th-229 Lasing Crystal&r is a thorium-doped crystal checked against the nuclear clock until it lases on the nucleus itself. The OpV emitter and the gamma optics works are built with one. The light that cools antihydrogen comes from a separate Lyman-alpha laser."]
			icon: "grindless:th229_lasing_crystal"
			id: "576E522130567846"
			rewards: [{ id: "590EB2C52D3B7EA5", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1D229E5913F37891", item: "grindless:th229_lasing_crystal", type: "item" }]
			title: "Th-229 Lasing Crystal"
			x: 17.5d
			y: 13.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32D17A8DE6EDF4A0"]
			description: ["The &6Strangelet Vault&r grows a strangelet seed inside a frozen field, where it cannot touch ordinary atoms, and feeds it until it is stable exotic matter. It also lines the cages and foils that strange matter needs. An OpV hull, the field-frozen casing and the annihilation shield casing, then seeds from the distiller and field-frozen plate. Its shape is 13 by 13 by 13, built by the Terminal in one pass. Stable exotic matter, which the Kugelblitz core and the gate to MAX need. Seeds go in by hatch and out by hatch; never keep them outside the vault."]
			icon: "gtceu:strangelet_vault"
			id: "3DB8108B84BC8C3C"
			rewards: [{ id: "75B37513AF5FDE52", type: "xp", xp: 150 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "5B734DA92CE3E8B2", item: "gtceu:strangelet_vault", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3AAC20D1C6275901", item: "grindless:field_frozen_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5C192FE3C357E222", item: "grindless:annihilation_shield_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Strangelet Vault"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 12.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["37DD95E0E3D6332E"]
			description: ["The &6Jet Beam Line&r draws protons from the base of the Cygnus X-1 jet and bunches them on superconducting cavities into a beam no Earth injector can reach. An OpV hull, the high power casing and SRF cryomodule blocks, with a chain field coil, an FRC cartridge and a field-frozen plate in the controller. Only its jet extraction is tied to Cygnus X-1. Its shape is 45 by 7 by 7, built by the Terminal in one pass. The proton beam for the antiproton complex, and through it every antiproton. Power and coolant by pipe; the beam is continuous, so give it a dedicated supply."]
			icon: "gtceu:jet_beam_line"
			id: "7B82C6325DA8F876"
			rewards: [{ id: "572EB6DF544FE3F1", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "32925750B3572DCE", item: "gtceu:jet_beam_line", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7260292334065BD6", item: "gtceu:high_power_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1510099F459EB377", item: "grindless:srf_cryomodule_block", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Jet Beam Line"
			x: 25.0d
			y: 21.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B1E66BC13548877"]
			description: ["The &6SRF Cryomodule Block&r is a niobium cavity in its own cryostat, which accelerates a beam with very little loss. The jet beam line and the antiproton decelerator are built of them, so make them first."]
			icon: "grindless:srf_cryomodule_block"
			id: "37DD95E0E3D6332E"
			rewards: [{ id: "72977405F90DC6CB", type: "xp", xp: 80 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "74A81A67A1C1C63C", item: "grindless:srf_cryomodule_block", type: "item" }]
			title: "SRF Cryomodule Block"
			x: 22.5d
			y: 22.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7B82C6325DA8F876"]
			description: ["The &6Antiproton Complex&r is four machines in one hall, one recipe row each. An iridium target and a lithium hydride shield make a hot antiproton beam; stochastic and electron cooling slow it, and ELENA, the last ring, bunches it into a Penning trap: the &6Cold Antiproton Cell&r. An OpV hull, the NEG XHV and annihilation shield casings and SRF cryomodule blocks, behind the jet beam line. Each row burns a part: target, pickup, electron cooler, or a trap. Its shape is 29 by 7 by 29, built by the Terminal in 2 passes. The cold antiproton cell for the antihydrogen foundry, and the antiproton stacks. Parts by ME; the empty traps come back from the foundry, so loop them."]
			icon: "gtceu:antiproton_decelerator"
			id: "1458D096423EA6D4"
			rewards: [{ id: "3F362D833F72AD18", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1C2B29552AAA6417", item: "gtceu:antiproton_decelerator", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3B95E711A1BDA15A", item: "gtceu:high_power_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3FD09E0339166D35", item: "grindless:neg_xhv_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "3B33786B56C4A343", item: "grindless:srf_cryomodule_block", type: "item" }
				{ id: "7F4C0F3D76B21C88", item: "grindless:annihilation_shield_casing", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Antiproton Complex"
			x: 30.0d
			y: 21.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1458D096423EA6D4"]
			description: ["The &6Strangelet Distiller&r boils the strangeness out of a lead-208 fireball and catches it as a droplet seed, catalysed by a pasta core sample. An OpV hull, the field-frozen casing and fusion glass. Its shape is 19 by 11 by 11, built by the Terminal in one pass. The strangelet seed, and the exotic matter after it. Beam and sample by ME; seeds go straight to the vault."]
			icon: "gtceu:strangelet_distiller"
			id: "5ACC310114FACE71"
			rewards: [{ id: "364CC46524130D2C", type: "xp", xp: 200 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [
				{ id: "3E7BACAB3C70007F", item: "gtceu:strangelet_distiller", type: "item" }
				{ id: "51A921F2C9CF8600", item: "grindless:field_frozen_casing", type: "item" }
				{ id: "31F08524567A988C", item: "gtceu:fusion_glass", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "Strangelet Distiller"
			x: 35.0d
			y: 21.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5ACC310114FACE71"]
			description: ["The &6Kugelblitz Forge&r crowds so much light into one point that it collapses into a black hole made of light. It is the largest machine of the age. An OpV hull, field-frozen and annihilation shield casing, and fusion coils, with the gamma optics works and a huge power supply behind it. Its shape is 23 by 17 by 23, built by the Terminal in 3 passes. The kugelblitz core, and the Hawking radiation of the collector. Feed power and gammas by hatch; build the shield first and the coils last."]
			icon: "gtceu:kugelblitz_forge"
			id: "196E5592451BC661"
			rewards: [{ id: "52BA5C6DB47D00E6", type: "xp", xp: 300 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
